{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8f93a8dc-b1a3-8493-b04f-61b9a2776605",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T09:56:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Julio Ortiz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:53:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:53:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi Kevin. Julio Ortiz here. Sorry, I'm on speaker, I'm just getting my head back on. I was sleeping a good long while and I'm still a little foggy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:53:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:53:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the storm drain out front of my house, it's been grunting. Slow, you know, kind of gurgles. And any time we get a thaw, the water just sits and backs up into the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:54:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the drain's slow and it backs up when the snow melts. Was there a storm recently, or is this just the melt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:54:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No storm. It's been dry. Just the days it warms up a little and the ice goes. Down the Point we get that, but this one's been worse than usual."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:54:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Dry-weather drainage, then. Let me write that down. Can I get the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:54:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, [pause] sorry, I'm gonna skip that on this call. I can give you a callback number though. It's 401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:54:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0162. Hmm, without the address the crew's going to have a hard time finding the right drain. Is there a cross street or a landmark you'd be comfortable with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:55:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's down the Point, on the quiet end. Close to the water side. I'd rather not say the house number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:55:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll note down the Point, water side, quiet end, and that you want a call back. Somebody may need to ask you for more to pinpoint it. What would you like done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:55:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd like the drain cleaned out. Whatever they do, rod it, vacuum it, I don't know. It needs clearing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:55:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cleaned out, okay. Is it just a nuisance, or is it causing a problem for anybody?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:55:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, there's an older neighbor next door who can't get out when it's pooled up. She's got a walker, and the water covers the whole curb cut. She just stays in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:55:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's good to know. I'll put that in the notes so it gets looked at sooner. Is the water ever up on the sidewalk or just the street edge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:56:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, sometimes. Street edge mostly, but when it's bad it crosses the sidewalk and then freezes at night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:56:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so pooling that freezes overnight. Slow drain, backs up on thaw days, neighbor with a walker can't get out. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:56:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's it. That's all of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:56:23-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I'll send this to the drainage crew supervisor. I can't tell you the exact day they'll get out there, they're working through a list, but someone will call you at that number to confirm the location."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:56:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I appreciate it, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:56:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Get some coffee in you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:56:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, I will. Thanks. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T09:56:48-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye."
    }
  ],
